  unitName: Axe God Mariudeth
  unitId: 20455
  unitNumber: 615
  description: Long before the battle between the humans and the gods, a supreme
    ruler was able to build his own vast territory in the historical Agni Empire.
    It is said that while wielding a giant axe with great ease that normally took
    the strength of three men to lift, he split in half the giants his enemies had
    employed as mercenaries while fighting in the frontlines. However, some wizards
    doubted his abilities, though the supreme ruler paid them no mind and laughed
    their rumors off heartily.
  summonDesc: No matter how many people<br>you get on your side,<br>in the end you
    can only rely on your own power.
  fusionDesc: It doesn't matter<br>how close you are to someone,<br>one day you will
    part.<br>It doesn't mean anything.
  evoDesc: My black axe feels light.<br>Seems like you know a thing or two<br>about
    the essence of power.
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
